{"channelId":"UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","row":["AMR Physiotherapy",32300,"Welcome to AMR Physiotherapy!\n\nWe’re here to guide you on your journey to a healthier, stronger, and more balanced body.\n\nOur focus spans three key areas:\n- Rehab to recover from pain and injuries\n- Gym training to reduce future injury risks\n- Longevity to keep you moving and feeling great for years to come.\n\nIf you’ve been hitting the gym or playing sports but are now dealing with more niggles or injuries, this channel is for you. We’ll help you stay fit, look good, and adopt a health-first, well-rounded training approach.\n\nAt AMR Physiotherapy, we believe that strengthening often-overlooked areas—like the neck and lower back—should be just as common as training biceps or chest. By addressing these neglected muscles and movements, we aim to help you stay resilient, reduce pain, and enjoy long-term health.\n\nJoin us to explore practical rehab tips, targeted exercises, and training techniques that keep your body balanced, strong, and ready for whatever life throws your way.","info@amrphysionottingham.co.uk","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:41.445Z","channelId":"UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"6dd20f65356de1e88571431177f18eaad7a96ec18111c066d8a97ac492132896","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b604a38ce58e37d63b4f8f70a68c6426a24b212b60f92a90137fefb768211f05"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:22:20.840Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":32300,"raw":"32.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2B7Dr18DkozSwsNg0sNZJg","obse